Playing NetHack 3.0 with patches 1 and 2 installed, I was polymorphing myself
and became a Queen Killer Bee (this made sense, since I started as V).
(still wondering what to do with these eggs, but that's not todays problem :-)
After having dropped everything (including $), I went to the stairs to the
previous level and tried to get upstairs. This I could not do as:
     "Your load is too heavy to climb the stairs"
In wizard mode it is quite reproducable.
Now this seems strange to me in at least two different ways:
1. as I am carring nothing, how can my load be too heavy ?
2. being a bee I should always be able to *fly* upstairs (cf after having
   drunk a potion of levitation you (as human) can only go upstairs)
Has this something to do with the fact that some monsters don't follow you
when you run up/down stairs ?
